  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n\r\n### Added\r\n\r\n- Add `nvidia-ml-py` 13.610.43 to support list by @XuehaiPan.\r\n- Add `nvidia-ml-py` 13.615.71 to support list by @XuehaiPan.\r\n- Add a responsive Rich GPU dashboard example with host metrics, MIG support, and GPU process snapshots by @XuehaiPan in #231.\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- Guard NVML field queries against a buffer overrun in NVIDIA driver 595.91.07 that can crash `nvitop-exporter` while collecting NVLink throughput by @XuehaiPan in #232.\r\n- Fix shared-memory accounting on unified-memory devices (e.g., NVIDIA DGX Spark and RTX Spark N1X) to include reclaimable cache in free memory and calculate used memory from available capacity by @johnnynunez in #234.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/XuehaiPan/nvitop/compare/v1.7.1...v1.7.2",
